1
00:00:00,385 --> 00:00:03,425
See it? "The common field cricket,
a.k.a. Gryllus assimilis"...

2
00:00:03,597 --> 00:00:05,847
...which is Latin for "suck it, you lose."

3
00:00:06,016 --> 00:00:07,936
(Sheldon:)Hang on.

4
00:00:08,769 --> 00:00:12,899
Voilà. "The snowy tree cricket,
a.k.a. Oecanthus fultoni"...

5
00:00:13,064 --> 00:00:15,444
...which is Latin for "I'll suck nothing."

6
00:00:15,942 --> 00:00:19,442
(Sheldon:)Of course, I'm joking, because the Latin
for that is "nihil exsorbibo."

7
00:00:19,613 --> 00:00:23,073
(Howard:)That is not Toby, this is Toby.

8
00:00:23,241 --> 00:00:24,781
(Howard:)Raj, what do you think?

9
00:00:25,327 --> 00:00:27,617
(Raj:)Oh. I really don't care anymore.

10
00:00:28,538 --> 00:00:29,708
[LEONARD SIGHS]

11
00:00:29,873 --> 00:00:33,043
(Leonard:)-God, I had the most horrible night.
-What happened?

12
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:37,210
(Sheldon:)Obviously another carnal fiasco
with the "shiksi" goddess.

13
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:38,880
(Howard:)Shiksa. Shiksa.

14
00:00:39,049 --> 00:00:43,089
(Sheldon:)Forgive me.
Yiddish was not spoken in East Texas.

15
00:00:43,261 --> 00:00:46,391
(Sheldon:)And if it was,
it wasn't spoken for long.

16
00:00:46,556 --> 00:00:49,596
(Howard:)Yeah, fine, whatever.
The point is you're wrong, again.

17
00:00:49,768 --> 00:00:52,058
(Sheldon:)We haven't established
that I'm wrong once.

18
00:00:52,229 --> 00:00:54,689
(Howard:)Let's go down
to the Entomology Department...

19
00:00:54,856 --> 00:00:58,026
...and let Professor Crawley tell us
what kind of cricket Toby is.

20
00:00:58,193 --> 00:01:02,023
SHELDON: He's a snowy tree cricket.
And his name is Jiminy.

